                                                "sense_id": "07d23696-3d57-33db-be6a-ab67d8100f13",
                                                "text": "Overseas Chinese communities exist in North and South America."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39dcfbec-4b5b-407c-8c25-2ac41c5cb0c5",
                                                "sense_id": "07d23696-3d57-33db-be6a-ab67d8100f13",
                                                "text": "The reputations of our universities and our research base are already under threat because of the fallout from the EU referendum result, which is making the UK an unfriendlier place for overseas scholars and students, as well as cutting off access to an important stream of research funding and to a vibrant and well-developed ecosystem for collaborative work."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
